-- carry-forward and seller shortfall damages; price formulas with averaging,
-- lag, reset and rounding; the domestic gas prices of PIA s.167 and s.168;
-- and the Domestic Gas Delivery Obligation of s.110.
--
-- AN ENGINE COURSE. There is no Suite app: the practicals run in the course's
-- own ledger calculator. The capstone grades six quantities of this tier, each
-- identical under every reading the engine states.
-- ============================================================================

